#. Description of the plugin
#: mg-stealth.php
msgid "Makes it hard to tell that a site runs WordPress: clean page source and headers, neutral public paths, a private login address, closed REST API for guests, the normal 404 page for typical WordPress addresses and one-hop 301 redirects to https and the main host name."
msgstr ""

