msgstr ""

#: includes/class-admin.php:409
msgid "WordPress' own sitemap at <code>/sitemap.xml</code> instead of <code>/wp-sitemap.xml</code>, without its stylesheet. Has no effect when an SEO plugin provides the sitemap. Submit the new address in Search Console."
msgstr ""

